@JonasVautherin I think the issue is connected to the fact that `is_connected` and `has_autopilot` are not necessarily in sync.

So, when any message from sysid 1, compid 1 arrives, you will be told that `has_autopilot` is true, however, it is not connected yet, until a heartbeat arrives.

To fix this we could consider not accepting any message until a heartbeat from a sysid/compid is received.

